  "title": "Inside the National Equity Trade Certification and Network",
  "summary": "Founded in 2019, the National Equity Trade Certification and Network is building long-term pathways for equity and legacy cannabis businesses to thrive. Based in Oakland and operating nationwide, the network connects purpose-driven brands with the resources, relationships, and infrastructure needed to succeed—centering community, culture, and economic repair at every step.",
